   "widgets_values": [
    "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cozy late-night podcast studio with warm practical lights, a wide shot frames two hosts at a wooden table with microphones, headphones and two white coffee mugs printed with \"DMAD\" in bold black letters, big glowing magenta backlit LED channel letters spelling \"DMAD\" on the brick wall behind them, each solid letter lit evenly from within with a soft halo on the bricks. [Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of a young man with curly hair leaning toward his microphone, and the man (S1) says: <d>[English] So you're telling me it makes a whole video in four steps?</d> [Shot 3] At 00:06.000, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of a woman with short black hair and round glasses who smiles, raises one hand beside her face and holds up exactly four fingers toward the camera, thumb folded in, keeping the hand steady, and the woman (S2) says: <d>[English] Four steps. Video and sound, together.</d> [Shot 4] At 00:09.500, the camera cuts back to the man, who throws his hands up in disbelief and laughs. [Shot 5] At 00:12.000, the camera cuts to a wide shot as both hosts laugh and clink their white \"DMAD\" coffee mugs under the glowing DMAD letters, the letters on the mugs staying crisp as they move.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet studio room tone, close-miked voices, chairs creaking, laughter, and the clink of ceramic mugs.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A mellow lo-fi beat playing softly underneath, swelling slightly at the end.",
